msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:55
#. Diagram label
msgid "Extraction authorised"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:123
#. Diagram label
msgid "First release"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:156
#. Diagram label
msgid "green"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:108
#. Diagram label
msgid "Green from a fresh clone?"
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:109
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Green goes to the owner. Red is fixed in the new repository, not in the staged copy, and goes back to the re-point. A clone that could not run is not a pass: stop."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:90
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "In the new repository `livesAt` goes (absent means it sits at the root of `repository`) and `platform.ts` points at where the platform now is. The host consumes it as a remote mount (a `source.remote` instance in its root `index.config.json`) if it imports its code, or a subscription if it only reads its content, pinned to a commit while staging. Additive: the host keeps its copy."
msgstr ""

#: processes/kg/kg-separation-move.bpmn:17
#. Diagram label
msgid "Move the graph into its repositories"
msgstr ""

